  "sourceTitle": "Pakistani Mint Raita",
  "sourceText": "Pakistani Mint Raita\nBy: miansari66\nPublished: Monday, January 10, 2011 - 1:34am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Yoghurt beaten\n3 teaspoons Fresh Mint leaves crushed\n3 teaspoons Fresh Coriander leaves crushed\n1 teaspoon Green Chillies crushed\nSalt to taste\n1/2 teaspoon Cumin powder\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add all ingredients to the yoghurt and mix well.\n\nAbout\n\n\nMint Raita is a Tangy, Delicious, Apetizing raita werved with Rice dishes, Tikka, Kabab in Pakistan.",
